  "description": {
   "en": "“What do all living beings live for, and what do they die for?”\n\nA lone Tyrannosaurus, abandoned by the world, slowly ages and approaches death. But before its final breath, it finds a dream—one last purpose to fulfill.\n\nA strange yet extraordinary tale of the lives that have walked this land and the ones that have perished upon it."
